0Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111104352765243732"],"id":"2111104352765243732","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":118,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🙏 মা দুর্গার চরণে প্রণাম, সকলের মঙ্গল কামনায়। 🙏\n\nআজ পুরশুড়া বিধানসভার পুরশুড়া সার্বজনীন শ্রী শ্রী দুর্গোৎসব কমিটি এবং বিশিষ্ট সমাজসেবী মাননীয় সুশান্ত কুমার বেড়া মহাশয়ের পূজা, পুরশুড়া উত্তরপাড়া শীতলতলা সার্বজনীন কমিটির শুভ উদ্বোধনী অনুষ্ঠানে উপস্থিত থাকার সৌভাগ্য হলো। https://t.co/cDqSJw1z8S","url":"https://x.com/BimanGhoshBJP/status/2111104352765243732"},{"author_id":"2074369902341918720","created_at":"2026-10-16T12:54:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111078359392502113"],"id":"2111078359392502113","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"North Kolkata’s Durga Puja Themes 2026: Which Pandals Stand Out?\n\nKashi Bose Lane: ‘আদিম’\nNabin Pally\nKumartuli\nAhiritola\nPandal-hopping plans\n\nDiscover what makes Durga Puja 2026 worth exploring. Watch the video for a closer look 👇\nhttps://t.co/6GobBLX8jy","url":"https://x.com/Mchatterjee099/status/2111078359392502113"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111014249019723776","13_2111014319051907072","3_2111014450774016000","3_2111014561457623040"]},"author_id":"2001891316582760448","created_at":"2026-10-16T08:41:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111014681683132422"],"id":"2111014681683132422","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1285,"like_count":36,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110802185584054626","type":"quoted"}],"text":"📌Nalin Sarkar Street\nBest Maa Durga theme Idol according to me among all I have seen https://t.co/G2mG6jLp9E https://t.co/jYBMsii6go","url":"https://x.com/kkr_russell/status/2111014681683132422"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110977127692877825"]},"author_id":"819130177","created_at":"2026-10-16T06:12:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110977142549029164"],"id":"2110977142549029164","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":164,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"পুজো মানেই আনন্দ, পুজো মানেই মিলন। তাই উৎসবের আলো ছড়িয়ে পড়ুক সবার ঘরে—প্রবীণ ও বিশেষভাবে সক্ষমদের পাশে দাঁড়িয়ে পুজোকে সবার করে তোলার উদ্যোগ রাজ্যের নগরোন্নয়ন ও পুর বিষয়ক দপ্তরের। বুধবার দক্ষিণ কলকাতার সুরুচি সঙ্ঘের প্রবীণ ও বিশেষভাবে সক্ষম মানুষদের জন্য বিশেষ ‘রেস্টিং https://t.co/MfwVI7Pcpr","url":"https://x.com/Ei_Samay/status/2110977142549029164"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110943003372404736","3_2110943021902835712","3_2110943038306697216"]},"author_id":"3236685834","created_at":"2026-10-16T03:56:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110943053808873658"],"id":"2110943053808873658","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":55,"impression_count":14580,"like_count":354,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":45},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110939343669874692","type":"quoted"}],"text":"My mind still can't comprehend what I witnessed last night.\nTala Barowari 2026 will go down in the history books of Calcutta Pujo.\n\nPictures don't do enough justice to this masterpiece. You have to be there and feel the energy emnating from it. https://t.co/Xz1cBh79Sr https://t.co/zjDvutctOs","url":"https://x.com/goonereol/status/2110943053808873658"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110939280168382464","3_2110939297285349376","3_2110939314662330368","3_2110939330076413952"]},"author_id":"3236685834","created_at":"2026-10-16T03:42:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110939343669874692"],"id":"2110939343669874692","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":16,"impression_count":16204,"like_count":170,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":23},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110768253572362559","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Another banger of Pujo 2026. \nA surreal experience last night at Tala Barowari.\nTheir theme - 'DurgaBari'. The Pandal has various forms of Goddess D